    Features/Learn/{VocabularyView, StudyModeView, PracticeView}.swift
    Learn/{PronunciationPractice, PronunciationScorer, SpeechReader,
           VocabularyExporter, VocabularyExtractor, VocabularyLevel,
           WordFrequencyTable}.swift
    ASR/{DiarizationService, SherpaDiarizer, SherpaSpeakerEmbedder}.swift
    Store/{SpeakerProfileStore, SpeakerTimeline, VocabularyStore}.swift

  内置模型（CI 不再下载、不再打包）：
    pyannote_segmentation_3_0.onnx（6.6 MB）
    campplus_zh_en_16k.onnx（27 MB）        → 安装包约 −33.6 MB
  词频表：Resources/WordLists（en_top10k / zh_top20k）→ CI 整段删除

